== TH-006 'square root of a number added to itself ... more than that number' (39:50) ==
reading R1: 2*sqrt(n) > n   <=> n in Interval.open(0, 4)
reading R2: x + x > x^2     <=> x in Interval.open(0, 2)
   integers 1..10: R1 holds for 3, R2 holds for 1
   integers 1..100: R1 holds for 3, R2 holds for 1
   integers 1..1000000: R1 holds for 3, R2 holds for 1

